{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-systems","title":"Memory 记忆系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/memory-systems","wordCount":1488,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"memory-记忆系统\">Memory 记忆系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在 AI 编程中，<strong>记忆</strong>（Memory）是指 AI 在对话之间以及跨会话中持久化和检索信息的能力。如果上下文决定了&quot;AI 这一轮能看到什么&quot;，那么记忆决定的是&quot;AI 在全新对话中还能记住什么&quot;。</p>\n<p>人类开发者在长期合作中会积累对项目的深层理解——编码风格偏好、架构约定、曾经踩过的坑、团队的技术选型原则。AI 的记忆系统试图模拟这种能力，让 AI 不仅是一个无状态的代码生成器，而是一个能够逐渐&quot;了解&quot;你和你项目的编程伙伴。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[User Interaction] --&gt; B{Memory Type}&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Episodic Memory&lt;br/&gt;Conversation history / Events&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Semantic Memory&lt;br/&gt;Facts / Preferences / Knowledge&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Procedural Memory&lt;br/&gt;Learned patterns / Skills&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Memory Storage]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[Load in next session]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Enhance AI Performance]\">flowchart TD\n    A[User Interaction] --&gt; B{Memory Type}\n    B --&gt; C[\"Episodic Memory&lt;br/&gt;Conversation history / Events\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Semantic Memory&lt;br/&gt;Facts / Preferences / Knowledge\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Procedural Memory&lt;br/&gt;Learned patterns / Skills\"]\n    C --&gt; F[Memory Storage]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[Load in next session]\n    G --&gt; H[Enhance AI Performance]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h2><h3 id=\"记忆的三种类型\">记忆的三种类型</h3><p>借鉴认知科学中的记忆分类，AI 编程中的记忆可分为三种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记忆类型</th>\n<th>认知科学类比</th>\n<th>AI 编程中的含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>情景记忆</td>\n<td>个人经历的回忆</td>\n<td>对话历史、操作记录</td>\n<td>&quot;上次我们讨论了认证模块的重构&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义记忆</td>\n<td>通用事实和知识</td>\n<td>用户偏好、项目规则、技术栈</td>\n<td>&quot;这个项目使用 ESLint + Prettier&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程序性记忆</td>\n<td>学会的技能和习惯</td>\n<td>代码风格模式、常用工作流</td>\n<td>&quot;用户偏好函数式风格而非 class&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"短期记忆-vs-长期记忆\">短期记忆 vs 长期记忆</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Short_term_Memory[&quot;Short-term Memory&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        S1[&quot;Current conversation context&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;Tool call results&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;Temporary reasoning state&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Long_term_Memory[&quot;Long-term Memory&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        L1[&quot;User preferences and rules&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;Project knowledge base&quot;]&#10;        L3[&quot;Conversation history summaries&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Short_term_Memory --&gt;|&quot;On session end&lt;br/&gt;Extract &amp; persist&quot;| Long_term_Memory&#10;    Long_term_Memory --&gt;|&quot;On new session start&lt;br/&gt;Load &amp; inject&quot;| Short_term_Memory\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Short_term_Memory[\"Short-term Memory\"]\n        direction TB\n        S1[\"Current conversation context\"]\n        S2[\"Tool call results\"]\n        S3[\"Temporary reasoning state\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Long_term_Memory[\"Long-term Memory\"]\n        direction TB\n        L1[\"User preferences and rules\"]\n        L2[\"Project knowledge base\"]\n        L3[\"Conversation history summaries\"]\n    end\n    Short_term_Memory --&gt;|\"On session end&lt;br/&gt;Extract &amp; persist\"| Long_term_Memory\n    Long_term_Memory --&gt;|\"On new session start&lt;br/&gt;Load &amp; inject\"| Short_term_Memory</pre><p><strong>短期记忆</strong>本质上就是当前对话的上下文窗口内容。它的特点是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>容量受上下文窗口限制</li>\n<li>会话结束后自动丢失</li>\n<li>随对话推进不断更新</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>长期记忆</strong>则通过外部存储机制实现跨会话的信息持久化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储在文件系统、数据库或云端</li>\n<li>新会话开始时自动或按需加载</li>\n<li>需要主动管理（写入、更新、清理）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"记忆的生命周期\">记忆的生命周期</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MemorySystem {&#10;  encode(interaction: Interaction): MemoryEntry;&#10;  store(entry: MemoryEntry): void;&#10;  retrieve(query: string): MemoryEntry[];&#10;  consolidate(): void;&#10;  forget(criteria: ForgetCriteria): void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MemoryEntry {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  type: &#39;episodic&#39; | &#39;semantic&#39; | &#39;procedural&#39;;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;  relevance: number;&#10;  source: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemorySystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">interaction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Interaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  retrieve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  consolidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  forget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">criteria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ForgetCriteria</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'episodic'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'semantic'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'procedural'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  relevance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>记忆的生命周期包含五个阶段：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>编码</strong>：将交互信息转化为可存储的记忆条目</li>\n<li><strong>存储</strong>：将记忆条目写入持久化存储</li>\n<li><strong>检索</strong>：根据当前上下文查找相关的历史记忆</li>\n<li><strong>巩固</strong>：合并冗余记忆、提炼关键信息</li>\n<li><strong>遗忘</strong>：清理过时或不再相关的记忆</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"关键要素\">关键要素</h2><h3 id=\"情景记忆-对话历史\">情景记忆：对话历史</h3><p>情景记忆记录的是&quot;发生了什么&quot;——具体的对话内容、AI 执行的操作、产生的结果。它是最直观的记忆形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"episodic_memory:&#10;  - session: &#39;2026-03-28T10:30:00Z&#39;&#10;    summary: &#39;重构了用户认证模块，将 JWT 刷新逻辑抽取为独立服务&#39;&#10;    files_modified:&#10;      - src/auth/token-service.ts&#10;      - src/auth/middleware.ts&#10;    outcome: &#39;成功，所有测试通过&#39;&#10;&#10;  - session: &#39;2026-03-27T14:00:00Z&#39;&#10;    summary: &#39;排查了数据库连接池泄漏问题&#39;&#10;    root_cause: &#39;事务未在 finally 中释放连接&#39;&#10;    files_modified:&#10;      - src/db/connection-pool.ts&#10;    outcome: &#39;修复成功&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">episodic_memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-03-28T10:30:00Z'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'重构了用户认证模块，将 JWT 刷新逻辑抽取为独立服务'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    files_modified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">src/auth/token-service.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">src/auth/middleware.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'成功，所有测试通过'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-03-27T14:00:00Z'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'排查了数据库连接池泄漏问题'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    root_cause</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'事务未在 finally 中释放连接'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    files_modified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">src/db/connection-pool.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'修复成功'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"语义记忆-事实与偏好\">语义记忆：事实与偏好</h3><p>语义记忆存储的是脱离了具体事件的通用知识——项目规则、用户偏好、技术栈信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;project_facts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;language&quot;: &quot;TypeScript 5.x&quot;,&#10;    &quot;runtime&quot;: &quot;Node.js 22&quot;,&#10;    &quot;package_manager&quot;: &quot;pnpm&quot;,&#10;    &quot;test_framework&quot;: &quot;Vitest&quot;,&#10;    &quot;style&quot;: &quot;ESLint + Prettier&quot;,&#10;    &quot;architecture&quot;: &quot;模块化单体，按功能划分目录&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;user_preferences&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code_style&quot;: &quot;函数式优先，避免 class&quot;,&#10;    &quot;naming&quot;: &quot;camelCase for variables, PascalCase for types&quot;,&#10;    &quot;error_handling&quot;: &quot;偏好 Result 模式而非 try-catch&quot;,&#10;    &quot;comments&quot;: &quot;代码应自解释，仅在复杂逻辑处添加注释&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"project_facts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"language\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TypeScript 5.x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"runtime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Node.js 22\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"package_manager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test_framework\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Vitest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ESLint + Prettier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"architecture\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"模块化单体，按功能划分目录\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_preferences\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"code_style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"函数式优先，避免 class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"naming\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"camelCase for variables, PascalCase for types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"error_handling\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"偏好 Result 模式而非 try-catch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"comments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"代码应自解释，仅在复杂逻辑处添加注释\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"程序性记忆-学到的模式\">程序性记忆：学到的模式</h3><p>程序性记忆是 AI 从反复交互中&quot;学到&quot;的行为模式，类似于肌肉记忆：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"模式 1：用户提交代码前总是要求先运行 lint 和 typecheck&#10;模式 2：用户偏好在修改代码后立即查看 diff&#10;模式 3：用户习惯用 @codebase 搜索后再精确引用文件&#10;模式 4：错误修复时，用户总是要求同时补充测试用例\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>模式 1：用户提交代码前总是要求先运行 lint 和 typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>模式 2：用户偏好在修改代码后立即查看 diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>模式 3：用户习惯用 @codebase 搜索后再精确引用文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>模式 4：错误修复时，用户总是要求同时补充测试用例</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"trae-的-ai-brain-系统\">Trae 的 ai-brain 系统</h3><p>Trae 通过 <code>ai-brain</code> 技能实现了一套完整的记忆管理系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/.learnwy/ai/memory/&#10;├── identity/&#10;│   ├── AI.md           ← AI 的身份定义&#10;│   └── you.md          ← 用户画像&#10;├── conversation/&#10;│   └── history/        ← 近期对话记录&#10;└── deeper/             ← 深层长期知识\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/.learnwy/ai/memory/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── identity/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── AI.md           ← AI 的身份定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── you.md          ← 用户画像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── conversation/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── history/        ← 近期对话记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── deeper/             ← 深层长期知识</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其核心工作流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 会话开始 → 加载身份和历史记忆&#10;bash ~/.trae-cn/skills/ai-brain/scripts/session.sh start&#10;&#10;# 会话中 → 追加重要信息到历史&#10;bash ~/.trae-cn/skills/ai-brain/scripts/append-history.sh &quot;完成认证模块重构&quot;&#10;&#10;# 会话结束 → 反思并巩固记忆&#10;bash ~/.trae-cn/skills/ai-brain/scripts/session.sh end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 会话开始 → 加载身份和历史记忆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.trae-cn/skills/ai-brain/scripts/session.sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 会话中 → 追加重要信息到历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.trae-cn/skills/ai-brain/scripts/append-history.sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"完成认证模块重构\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 会话结束 → 反思并巩固记忆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.trae-cn/skills/ai-brain/scripts/session.sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种基于文件系统的方案简单透明——用户可以直接查看和编辑 AI 的记忆内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"claude-的记忆文件\">Claude 的记忆文件</h3><p>Claude Code 通过 <code>CLAUDE.md</code> 文件实现项目级记忆：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- CLAUDE.md — 放置在项目根目录 --&gt;&#10;&#10;## 项目概述&#10;&#10;这是一个电商平台的后端服务，使用 TypeScript + Fastify。&#10;&#10;## 编码规范&#10;&#10;- 所有 API 返回统一的 Result 类型&#10;- 数据库操作必须在 Service 层，Controller 不直接访问数据库&#10;- 使用 Zod 进行请求参数校验&#10;&#10;## 注意事项&#10;&#10;- 不要修改 src/legacy/ 目录下的代码&#10;- 支付模块的测试需要 mock 第三方 API\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- CLAUDE.md — 放置在项目根目录 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 项目概述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">这是一个电商平台的后端服务，使用 TypeScript + Fastify。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 编码规范</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 所有 API 返回统一的 Result 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 数据库操作必须在 Service 层，Controller 不直接访问数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 使用 Zod 进行请求参数校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 注意事项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 不要修改 src/legacy/ 目录下的代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 支付模块的测试需要 mock 第三方 API</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Claude 在每次会话开始时自动读取该文件，将其中的信息注入系统提示词。这种方式的优势在于版本控制友好——<code>CLAUDE.md</code> 可以随代码一起提交到 Git 仓库。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cursor-的-cursorrules\">Cursor 的 .cursorrules</h3><p>Cursor 使用 <code>.cursorrules</code> 文件（现已升级为 <code>.cursor/rules/</code> 目录）来存储项目规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# .cursorrules&#10;&#10;You are working on a Next.js 14 application with App Router.&#10;&#10;Technology stack:&#10;- Next.js 14 with App Router&#10;- TypeScript strict mode&#10;- Tailwind CSS for styling&#10;- Prisma for database access&#10;&#10;Conventions:&#10;- Use server components by default&#10;- Client components must have &quot;use client&quot; directive&#10;- API routes go in app/api/ directory&#10;- Shared types go in types/ directory\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># .cursorrules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>You are working on a Next.js 14 application with App Router.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Technology stack:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Next.js 14 with App Router</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- TypeScript strict mode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Tailwind CSS for styling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Prisma for database access</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Conventions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Use server components by default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Client components must have \"use client\" directive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- API routes go in app/api/ directory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Shared types go in types/ directory</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"记忆系统对比\">记忆系统对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Trae ai-brain</th>\n<th>Claude CLAUDE.md</th>\n<th>Cursor .cursorrules</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储位置</td>\n<td>全局文件系统</td>\n<td>项目根目录</td>\n<td>项目根目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用范围</td>\n<td>跨项目</td>\n<td>单项目</td>\n<td>单项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动更新</td>\n<td>支持（脚本驱动）</td>\n<td>手动维护</td>\n<td>手动维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本控制</td>\n<td>独立于项目</td>\n<td>随项目提交</td>\n<td>随项目提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆类型</td>\n<td>情景 + 语义 + 身份</td>\n<td>主要是语义</td>\n<td>主要是程序性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队共享</td>\n<td>不共享</td>\n<td>可共享</td>\n<td>可共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在团队协作中，将 <code>CLAUDE.md</code> 或 <code>.cursorrules</code> 提交到代码仓库，可以让所有团队成员的 AI 助手获得一致的项目知识。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><h3 id=\"误区一-ai-自动记住一切\">误区一：AI 自动记住一切</h3><p>当前的 AI 编程工具不会自动记住所有交互细节。除非通过专门的记忆机制（如 ai-brain 脚本或 CLAUDE.md 文件），否则每次新对话都是从零开始。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区二-记忆文件越详细越好\">误区二：记忆文件越详细越好</h3><p>过长的记忆文件会占用宝贵的上下文窗口空间。记忆应该是精炼的、高信号密度的——记录&quot;什么该做、什么不该做&quot;，而不是完整的历史叙述。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区三-忽视记忆的维护\">误区三：忽视记忆的维护</h3><p>记忆需要定期更新和清理。过时的记忆（如已弃用的架构决策、已删除的模块信息）不仅浪费上下文空间，还可能误导 AI 做出错误判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区四-将所有信息放在同一层\">误区四：将所有信息放在同一层</h3><p>不同类型的记忆应该分层管理。项目级规则放在 <code>.cursorrules</code> 或 <code>CLAUDE.md</code> 中，个人偏好放在全局配置中，临时上下文留在对话中。混合存放会导致信息冲突和管理混乱。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AI 的记忆分为<strong>情景记忆</strong>（对话历史）、<strong>语义记忆</strong>（事实和偏好）和<strong>程序性记忆</strong>（行为模式）三种类型。</li>\n<li><strong>短期记忆</strong>即当前对话的上下文，会话结束后消失；<strong>长期记忆</strong>通过外部存储实现跨会话持久化。</li>\n<li>记忆的生命周期包括编码、存储、检索、巩固和遗忘五个阶段。</li>\n<li>主流 AI 编程工具通过不同机制实现记忆：Trae 的 ai-brain（全局文件系统）、Claude 的 CLAUDE.md（项目级文件）、Cursor 的 .cursorrules（项目规则文件）。</li>\n<li>有效的记忆管理需要精炼、分层、定期维护，避免信息过时或冲突。</li>\n<li>记忆与上下文互补：记忆提供跨会话的持久知识，上下文提供单次会话的实时信息。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Memory 记忆系统","id":"memory-记忆系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"记忆的三种类型","id":"记忆的三种类型"},{"level":3,"text":"短期记忆 vs 长期记忆","id":"短期记忆-vs-长期记忆"},{"level":3,"text":"记忆的生命周期","id":"记忆的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"关键要素","id":"关键要素"},{"level":3,"text":"情景记忆：对话历史","id":"情景记忆-对话历史"},{"level":3,"text":"语义记忆：事实与偏好","id":"语义记忆-事实与偏好"},{"level":3,"text":"程序性记忆：学到的模式","id":"程序性记忆-学到的模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"Trae 的 ai-brain 系统","id":"trae-的-ai-brain-系统"},{"level":3,"text":"Claude 的记忆文件","id":"claude-的记忆文件"},{"level":3,"text":"Cursor 的 .cursorrules","id":"cursor-的-cursorrules"},{"level":3,"text":"记忆系统对比","id":"记忆系统对比"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":3,"text":"误区一：AI 自动记住一切","id":"误区一-ai-自动记住一切"},{"level":3,"text":"误区二：记忆文件越详细越好","id":"误区二-记忆文件越详细越好"},{"level":3,"text":"误区三：忽视记忆的维护","id":"误区三-忽视记忆的维护"},{"level":3,"text":"误区四：将所有信息放在同一层","id":"误区四-将所有信息放在同一层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Context 上下文管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/context-management"},"next":{"title":"代码库理解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/codebase-understanding"}}